# The blog lived at /insights/ for a few hours on 22 Sep 2026 and was submitted
# to IndexNow under those URLs before being renamed to /blog/. These keep the
# old paths working rather than returning 404 to anything that picked them up.
#
# Note for future edits: on Cloudflare Pages a static file always wins over a
# redirect rule, so a rule can never hide a path that still exists on disk.
# These work only because /insights/ no longer exists.
/insights/feed.xml   /blog/feed.xml   301
/insights/*          /blog/:splat     301
